## 10. Risks & mitigations (deduped, evidence-backed)

| # | Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|------|------------|--------|------------|
| R1 | Async base-class change breaks RE override | LOW | HIGH | Phase-0 signatures match RE's; cross-test both paths. |
| R2 | `Debuggable` decoupling breaks RE `__repr__` | LOW | LOW | Option (b): share `agent_foundation.utils.debuggable`. |
| R3 | MUI 5 vs MUI 7 divergence | MEDIUM | MEDIUM | `peerDep >=5 <8`; `createThemeFn` prop verified; CI matrix tests both. |
| R4 | CRA does not transpile `node_modules` | HIGH (would-be) | HIGH | **Ship pre-built CJS+ESM via `tsup`**; no `craco` needed. |
| R5 | `theme.custom.surfaces.*` bare access crashes | HIGH (already happens) | MEDIUM | Phase 1 mandates optional-chaining rewrite. |
| R6 | OS submit-guards lost during promotion | MEDIUM | MEDIUM | Phase-2 names OS as source-of-truth; explicit double-submit test. |
| R7 | Py↔JS widget-type drift returns | MEDIUM | HIGH | Codegen + CI `--check` (§5.1 + §8.1). |
| R8 | Big-bang migrations cause merge conflicts | MEDIUM | MEDIUM | Phases are per-bucket PRs; each independently shippable. |
| R9 | React 18 (AF/RE) vs React 19 (OS) | LOW | MEDIUM | `peerDep react>=18`; CI tests both. |
| R10 | Artifactory publishing pipeline missing | MEDIUM | MEDIUM | Phase 1 sets up `tsup`; Phase 5 sets up publish job. Interim: `npm pack` tarball. |
| R11 | ConversationToolWidget app-parsing leaks into dispatcher | HIGH | MEDIUM | Phase-2 extracts `parser` prop (default = identity). |
| R12 | RE's React fork is sometimes ahead of AF's | HIGH | LOW | §1 verified ground-truth dictates per-file source; `DECISIONS.md` logs each. |
| R13 | `interactive_checkpoint.py` async bug bites in production | LOW | HIGH | Phase-0 fixes first; regression test added. |
| R14 | `MULTIPLE_CHOICES` plural alias confuses new devs | LOW | LOW | Docstring + lint rule. |
| R15 | OS `PendingReasonPopover` resolution shape resists generalization | MEDIUM | LOW | Lift only after one soak release. |
| R16 | webaxon missing in deploy env crashes terminal transport | MEDIUM | MEDIUM | Phase-0 §3.6 makes it lazy + optional. |
| R17 | Cryptic-clock's off-by-one in RE's `file:` path | LOW | LOW (caught) | v3.0 uses verified 5-level path; RE prefers Artifactory anyway. |

