## 11. Sequence & timeline

```
Week 1: Phase 0 (3–4d) + Phase 1 (3d, parallelizable after Phase 0 day 1)
Week 2: Phase 2 — widget protocol canonicalization
Week 3: Phase 3 — extended primitives & hooks
Week 4–5: Phase 4a (RankEvolve) — Python first, then React
Week 4–5: Phase 4b (OpenStartup) — React only ← parallel with 4a
Week 6:   Phase 4c (AF demo cleanup) + Phase 5 (governance)
Ongoing:  Phase 5 — drift audits, releases
```

Critical path: Phase 0 → Phase 1 → Phase 2 → Phase 4a (RE Python).

