## 13. Open questions (decisions still needed)

1. **Artifactory namespace.** `@agent-foundation/ui-react` (rec.) vs `@atlassian/agent-foundation-ui-react`?
2. **TypeScript.** Stay JS+JSDoc through 1.0.0 (rec.) vs move to TS at 0.2.0?
3. **Storybook hosting.** GitHub Pages (rec.) vs Bitbucket Pipelines artifact?
4. **`Debuggable` resolution.** Drop inheritance (a) vs share `agent_foundation.utils.debuggable` (b — rec.)?
5. **Compat-shim lifetime.** Remove `legacyAdapter.js` at 0.2.0 (rec., ~2 months) vs 0.3.0 (~4 months)?
6. **RE coordination window.** 1-week release window for Phase 4a vs async best-effort?
7. **`webaxon` long-term.** Lazy import now (Phase 0); should we also extract `is_html_string` into `agent_foundation.utils.html`?

